00:57:15.140 --> 00:57:20.660
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia. Our message to him today?
<v Ira Glass>芝加哥 WBEZ 对我们节目的管理监督由我们的老板托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责。我们今天给他的信息是：

00:57:20.660 --> 00:57:23.930
<v Matt Malloy>We've shot you up full of preservatives. You'll stay fresh for a while yet.
<v Matt Malloy>我们给你注入了大量的防腐剂。你还能保持新鲜一段时间。

00:57:23.930 --> 00:57:43.240
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回《美国生活》的更多故事。

